graph TD
    subgraph "Cross-Cutting Context"
        TAX[Context & Taxonomy Model<br>- Dimensions: businessProcess, activity, subActivity, action<br>- Owned by Template Domain<br>- Mappings to Templates]
    end

    subgraph "Domains as Microservices"
        TMG["Template & Methodology Governance Domain<br>- Manage Templates (Schemas, Presentation, Layouts)<br>- Lifecycle: Draft->Reviewed->Approved->Published<br>- Methodology Rules & Validations<br>- Taxonomy Ownership"]
        WAL["Workpaper Authoring & Lifecycle Domain<br>- Create/Edit Workpapers (Structured Fields, Narratives)<br>- Lifecycle States: Draft->In Review->Approved->Finalized<br>- Immutable Versioning<br>- Exports with Hashes"]
        CR["Collaboration & Review Domain<br>- Threaded Comments & Assignments<br>- Parallel Editing & Presence<br>- Review Workflows & Notifications"]
        IAA["Intelligent Assistance & Automation Domain<br>- AI Orchestration Service<br>- Generative Assistance (Drafting, Summarizing)<br>- Agentic Workflows (Evidence Assembly, Pre-Populate)<br>- Human-in-the-Loop & Logging"]
        GAL["Governance, Audit Trail & Lineage Domain<br>- Append-Only Event Store<br>- Tamper-Evident Logs<br>- Data Lineage & Integrity Hashes<br>- Historical Reconstruction"]
        UAO["Usage Analytics & Operational Insights Domain<br>- Telemetry Collection & KPIs<br>- Dashboards for Bottlenecks & Adoption<br>- Projections from Events"]
        PCS["Platform & Cross-Cutting Services Domain<br>- IAM, SSO, RBAC/ABAC<br>- Security & Compliance<br>- Infrastructure & Observability<br>- Integration Framework"]
    end

    TMG -->|Schemas/Rules/Taxonomy| WAL
    WAL -->|Workpaper Context| CR
    WAL -->|Assistance Requests| IAA
    IAA -->|Interactions & Outputs| GAL
    CR -->|Comments/Reviews| GAL
    WAL -->|Versions/States| GAL
    AllDomains[All Domains] -->|Emit Events| EB[EventBridge<br>Central Event Bus]
    EB -->|Trigger/Notify| AllDomains
    EB -->|Audit Stream| GAL
    GAL -->|Projections| UAO
    UAO -->|Insights| TMG
    PCS -->|Provides Services To| AllDomains
    TAX -->|Used By| AllDomains

    subgraph "External Integrations (via PCS/Integration Framework)"
        EXT[External Systems<br>AuditBoard, APEX, GRC, Data Lake, GS-AI]
    end

    PCS -->|APIs/Events| EXT
    IAA -->|Governed Calls| EXT

